 "summary": "The invariant-form, complement-construction, shear-isometry and dual-form material has no counterpart in TauCeti's Cartan realization files or in Mathlib, and the PR reuses the existing Mathlib/TauCeti plumbing (prodEquivOfIsCompl, BilinForm.prod, IsRefl.nondegenerate_iff_separatingLeft, nondegenerate_neg_iff, CartanRealization.map_trans/map_refl). Mathlib's nondegenerate_iff_ker_eq_bot needs finiteness and IsReflective.isOrthogonal_reflection uses a form-derived coroot, so neither replaces the PR's general versions.",
